      will be overwritten.
    - method (str): Normalization method. Supported: "minmax", "zscore", "robust".
      - "minmax": scale to [0, 1] using (x - min) / (max - min)
      - "zscore": standardize to mean 0, std 1
      - "robust": center by median and scale by IQR (x - median) / IQR
    - columns (list or None): List of column names to normalize. If None, numeric columns
      will be detected and normalized.
    - delimiter (str): CSV delimiter (default ",").
    - missing_strategy (str): How to handle missing values before normalization. Options:
      - "drop": drop rows with missing values in the selected columns (default)
      - "fill_mean": fill missing numeric values with column mean
      - "fill_median": fill missing numeric values with column median
      - "none": leave missing values (may propagate NaNs)
    - inplace (bool): If True, overwrite input file. Otherwise write to output_path or a
